{"success": true, "name": "continual-arc-demo-synthesis", "file": "references/live-session-lookup-pitfall.md", "content": "# Live puzzle evidence synthesis: avoid lookup substitution

In an action-only Continual-ARC session, many repeated skill/reference lookups can crowd out the core operation: compare the newly returned input and output directly, record dimensions, changed cells, preserved cells, and implications for the current test. After each demo, update that ledger before choosing another request or submission.

